    "Archive and utility lists shown below your areas and projects. Drag to reorder within a section, or use the arrow button to move a list above or below. Changes sync across all your devices." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.copy.smart_lists_editor.bottomFooter.label. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archief- en hulplijsten staan onder je gebieden en projecten. Sleep om ze binnen een sectie te rangschikken, of gebruik de pijlknop om een lijst omhoog of omlaag te verplaatsen. Wijzigingen worden gesynchroniseerd met al je apparaten."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As listas de arquivo e utilitárias aparecem abaixo das áreas e dos projetos. Arraste para reordenar dentro de uma seção ou use as setas para mover uma lista para cima ou para baixo. As alterações são sincronizadas em todos os seus dispositivos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive and utility lists shown below your areas and projects. Use the arrows to reorder a list or to move it above or below. Changes sync across all your devices." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.copy.smart_lists_editor.bottomFooterButtons.label. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
