    "Beyond conversations, %@ learns small patterns locally, like the “Move to…” suggestion that predicts where a task belongs from your own history. That model trains on your device and never leaves it." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.copy.ai_explainer.localBody.label. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Naast gesprekken leert %@ lokaal kleine patronen, zoals de suggestie ‘Verplaatsen naar…’ die op basis van je eigen geschiedenis voorspelt waar een taak thuishoort. Het model wordt op je apparaat getraind en blijft daar."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Além das conversas, o %@ aprende pequenos padrões localmente, como a sugestão “Mover para…” que prevê onde uma tarefa deve ficar com base no seu próprio histórico. Esse modelo é treinado no seu dispositivo e nunca sai dele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
