    },
    "Each agent you connected to your tasks, with the name you gave it. An agent counts while it was used in the last 30 days. Your phones, tablets and computers are under Account, Devices." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.pages.agents.sections.agents.footer. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke agent die je aan je taken hebt gekoppeld, met de naam die je eraan hebt gegeven. Een agent telt mee als je die in de afgelopen 30 dagen hebt gebruikt. Je telefoons, tablets en computers staan onder Account, Apparaten."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada agente que você conectou às suas tarefas, com o nome que escolheu. Um agente conta se foi usado nos últimos 30 dias. Seus celulares, tablets e computadores aparecem em Conta, Dispositivos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app you signed in to. A device you sign out stops syncing within the hour." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.pages.devices_access.sections.devices.footer. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke app waarbij je bent aangemeld. Een apparaat waarvoor je je afmeldt, stopt binnen een uur met synchroniseren."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada app em que você iniciou sessão. Um dispositivo do qual você sair para de sincronizar em até uma hora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each project has notes, so you and Claude know what it's for." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.welcome.points.2.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
