          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every task feature is free on the device you use. A free account adds a backup and lets you connect one agent. Plus covers all your devices, three agents, synced files and a longer history." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.subhead. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elke functie voor taken is gratis op het apparaat dat je gebruikt. Een gratis account voegt een back-up toe en laat je één agent verbinden. Plus geldt voor al je apparaten, drie agents, gesynchroniseerde bestanden en een langere geschiedenis."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos os recursos de tarefas são gratuitos no dispositivo que você usa. Uma conta gratuita inclui um backup e permite conectar um agente. O Plus cobre todos os seus dispositivos, três agentes, arquivos sincronizados e um histórico mais longo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every task feature is free on the device you use. Plus syncs your list to all your devices and keeps its full history and files. It also lets your agents work without a daily cap." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry plans.subhead. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Everything in Free is included." : {
