    "Paste the first prompt. Claude sets up your areas and projects with you." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.connectClaude.instructions.2. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plak de eerste prompt. Claude richt samen met jou je gebieden en projecten in."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cole o primeiro prompt. O Claude monta suas áreas e projetos com você."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the setup prompt into Claude, or add the connector URL to Claude as a custom connector. When your browser shows a code, enter it here. Once connected, paste the first prompt to set up your areas, projects and tasks. Only enter a code from a browser window you opened yourself." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.copy.claude_connector.footer.label. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plak de installatieprompt in Claude, of voeg de connector-URL toe als aangepaste connector. Voer de code hier in zodra je browser die toont. Plak na het verbinden de eerste prompt om je gebieden, projecten en taken in te stellen. Voer alleen een code in van een browservenster dat je zelf hebt geopend."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cole o prompt de configuração no Claude ou adicione a URL do conector ao Claude como um conector personalizado. Quando o navegador mostrar um código, digite-o aqui. Depois de conectar, cole o primeiro prompt para configurar suas áreas, projetos e tarefas. Digite apenas códigos exibidos em uma janela do navegador que você mesmo abriu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
