      }
    },
    "Your task text and titles are never sent through analytics. This setting syncs across your devices." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.pages.privacy.sections.telemetry.footer. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je taakteksten en titels worden nooit via analytics verzonden. Deze instelling wordt op al je apparaten gesynchroniseerd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O texto e os títulos das suas tarefas nunca são enviados pelas análises. Este ajuste sincroniza entre seus dispositivos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tasks stay in step on iPhone, iPad and Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry surfaces.firstRun.steps.welcome.points.0.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je taken blijven gelijk op iPhone, iPad en Mac."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suas tarefas ficam em sincronia no iPhone, iPad e Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tasks, areas and projects" : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.copy.delete_account.tasks.label. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je taken, gebieden en projecten"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suas tarefas, áreas e projetos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tasks, areas, projects, and conversations stay on this device until you sign in. When signed in, they sync through Septena’s private server at api.septena.app, encrypted at rest (not end-to-end, so connected agents can read them when you choose). AI on your device stays on your device. Connect Claude under AI & Agents." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.pages.privacy.sections.data_locality.items.0.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je taken, gebieden, projecten en gesprekken blijven op dit apparaat totdat je je aanmeldt. Na aanmelding worden ze gesynchroniseerd via de privéserver van Septena op api.septena.app, versleuteld opgeslagen (niet end-to-end, zodat verbonden agents ze kunnen lezen wanneer jij daarvoor kiest). AI op je apparaat blijft op je apparaat. Verbind Claude onder AI en agents."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suas tarefas, áreas, projetos e conversas ficam neste dispositivo até você entrar. Depois de entrar, elas sincronizam pelo servidor privado do Septena em api.septena.app, criptografadas em repouso (não de ponta a ponta, então agentes conectados podem lê-las quando você escolher). A IA no seu dispositivo fica no seu dispositivo. Conecte o Claude em IA e agentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tasks, areas, projects, and conversations stay on this device until you sign in. When signed in, they sync through Septena's private server at api.septena.app, encrypted at rest (not end-to-end, so connected agents can read them when you choose). Apple's on-device intelligence runs locally; you can connect Claude under AI & Agents." : {
      "comment" : "Generated from registry settings.pages.privacy.sections.data_locality.items.0.detail. Edit registry/*.json or registry/l10n; Xcode edits are overwritten.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suas tarefas, áreas, projetos e conversas ficam neste dispositivo até você entrar. Depois de entrar, elas sincronizam pelo servidor privado do Septena em api.septena.app, criptografadas em repouso (não de ponta a ponta, então agentes conectados podem lê-las quando você escolher). A inteligência no dispositivo da Apple roda localmente; você pode conectar o Claude em IA e agentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
